# U34: item sets and the undo buffers (allflame_exp_007 has two sets). The idle frame (Load's
# ResetUndo: one undo state); untick the five flasks (U32's checkboxes: `slot.active`, the set's
# `active`, AddUndoState); open the set selector and pick the second set (U32's selFunc:
# SetActiveItemSet, its PopulateSlots tail and SyncLoadouts, AddUndoState; the set list refresh of
# Draw L1515-1523), snapshot; Ctrl+Z (Undo: RestoreUndoState with U34's PopulateSlots tail, the
# first set again), snapshot; Ctrl+Y (Redo), snapshot; Ctrl+D (showStatDifferences, saved in the
# Items section, L1488-1490), snapshot; the weapon set button "II" and Ctrl+Z twice (the second
# Undo goes back over the set switch); "I"; Ctrl+Y.
# (The flasks are unticked first: an undo state holds the slots' `selItemId` but not their
# `active`, so undoing across a set switch whose sets differ in flask `active` leaves PoB's live
# `slot.active` different from the set's saved `active`. PoB then calculates with the live value;
# U15's LuaCalcBridge loads the saved XML, which cannot carry it.)
#! u34-expect undo: 1 redo: 0 mod: false
#! u34-expect undo: 7 redo: 0 mod: true
#! u34-expect undo: 6 redo: 1 mod: true
#! u34-expect undo: 6 redo: 2 mod: true
#! u34-expect ^7set Animated Guardian
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_007.xml"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press 3
key-up CTRL
frames 3
move 396 340
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 396 362
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 396 384
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 396 406
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 396 428
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 515 49
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 515 86
frames 2
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
snapshot set2
move 1200 700
frames 1
key-down CTRL
press z
key-up CTRL
frames 3
snapshot undo
key-down CTRL
press y
key-up CTRL
frames 3
snapshot redo
key-down CTRL
press d
key-up CTRL
frames 3
snapshot statdiff
move 708 96
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 1200 700
frames 1
key-down CTRL
press z
key-up CTRL
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press z
key-up CTRL
frames 3
snapshot undo2
move 689 96
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 1200 700
key-down CTRL
press y
key-up CTRL
frames 3
snapshot after
